<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Maintenance accounts' }) %>
<section class="hero">
  <h1>Facilities maintenance on a prepaid account</h1>
  <p>Book maintenance for your residential and commercial properties, track every job with time-stamped photographic evidence, and pay from a prepaid maintenance balance that remains your account credit.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/register">Open a prepaid account</a><a class="btn secondary" href="/login">Sign in</a></div>
</section>
<div class="grid">
  <div class="card"><h2>1. Tell us about your portfolio</h2><p>Add your sites, buildings and units. We calculate the recommended minimum prepaid balance from transparent assumptions, typically between $1,000 and $15,000.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h2>2. Book jobs online</h2><p>Choose the site, unit, trade and priority. See an estimate and the applicable callout and after-hours rates before you book.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h2>3. Verified work, clear invoices</h2><p>Approved contractors record arrival, before-and-after photos and completion notes. You receive the report, the invoice and your account statement.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="card"><h2>Contractors</h2><p>Licensed and insured tradespeople can apply to receive jobs from Ridgeline. <a href="/contractors/apply">Apply to join our contractor network</a>.</p></div>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
